  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRC/ICRC 2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRK/ICRC 2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRKs samarbete med ICRC syftar till att st&#xF6;dja samarbetet mellan ICRC och SRK i den gemensamma implementeringen av vissa insatser inom ramen f&#xF6;r ICRC-appellen samt f&#xF6;r rekrytering av svenska delegater i ICRC-operationer p&#xE5; basis av svensk humanit&#xE4;r expertis.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRc&apos;s cooperation with the ICRC aims to support cooperation between the ICRC and SRC in the joint implementation of certain actions under the ICRC appeal and for the recruitment of Swedish delegates of the ICRC operations on the basis of Swedish humanitarian expertise.</narrative>
  </description>
